@startuml app-viewmodel-boundary
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam arrowThickness 1.5

title :app 与 :ime-ui 模块边界

legend right
  |= 模块 |= 颜色 |= 说明 |
  | :app | ##E3F2FD | Platform Layer |
  | :ime-ui | ##E8F5E9 | UI + ViewModel Layer |
  | :ime-engine | ##FFF3E0 | Domain + Data Layer |
endlegend

' ===== :app 模块 =====
package ":app 模块" #E3F2FD {

  class IMEService {
    - engine: ImeEngine?
    - bridge: InputConnectionBridge?
    + onCreate()
    + onCreateInputView(): View
    + onDestroy()
  }

  class ConfigDataStore {
    - context: Context
    + config: Flow<ImeConfig>
    + updateConfig(transform)
  }

  class InputConnectionBridge {
    - targetSupplier: () -> InputConnection?
  }

  class ImeApplication {
    + onCreate()
  }

  note right of IMEService
    **职责**
    - 创建 ImeEngine (需要 ImeDictProvider)
    - 创建并挂载 InputConnectionBridge
    - 注入 KeyboardViewModel.Factory(engine)
    - 管理 Service 生命周期
    - 配置持久化 (DataStore)
    - 日志系统初始化
  end note
}

' ===== :ime-ui 模块 =====
package ":ime-ui 模块" #E8F5E9 {

  class KeyboardViewModel {
    - engine: ImeEngine
    + state: StateFlow<ImeState>
    + config: ImeConfig
    + layoutMode: StateFlow<LayoutMode>
    + feedbackState: GestureFeedbackState
    + actionPlayer: InputActionPlayer
    + handleGesture(gesture)
    + handleIntent(intent)
    + setLayoutMode(mode)
    + updateConfig(transform)
    + updateKeyLayoutState(state)
    + updateCandidateLayoutState(state)
    + updateInputListLayoutState(state)
    + onCleared()
  }

  class KeyboardHost {
    + (Composable) KeyboardHost(viewModel)
  }

  class KeyboardInputActionPlayerHost {
    + UseMode.Animation / DirectInput
  }

  class GestureFeedbackState {
    + touchTrailPoints / pressedKeys / fingerIndicator
  }

  class InputActionPlayer {
    + playbackState
    + row1/row2 Indicator
  }

  class EditTextBridge {
    - targetSupplier: () -> EditText?
  }

  note right of KeyboardViewModel
    **职责**
    - 手势→意图分发
    - 状态暴露 (StateFlow<ImeState>)
    - 布局模式管理
    - 反馈状态持有
    - 动作播放器集成
    - 布局状态缓存
    - 运行时配置修改

    **不属于 ViewModel 的**
    - 创建 ImeEngine (:app)
    - 管理 InputConnectionBridge (:app)
    - 配置持久化 (:app)
    - 系统服务生命周期 (:app)
  end note
}

' ===== :ime-engine 模块 =====
package ":ime-engine 模块" #FFF3E0 {
  class ImeEngine {
    + state: StateFlow<ImeState>
    + handleIntent(intent)
    + updateConfig(block)
    + attachOutputBridge(bridge)
  }
  interface ImeOutputBridge {
    + commitText / revokeCommit / ...
  }
}

' ===== 交互关系 =====

IMEService --> ImeEngine : 创建\nImeEngine.create(config, dictProvider)
IMEService --> InputConnectionBridge : 创建并挂载\nengine.attachOutputBridge(bridge)
IMEService --> KeyboardViewModel : 注入\nKeyboardViewModel.Factory(engine)

KeyboardViewModel --> ImeEngine : 持有引用\nhandleIntent() / state / updateConfig()
KeyboardViewModel *-- GestureFeedbackState : 管理
KeyboardViewModel *-- InputActionPlayer : 集成

KeyboardHost --> KeyboardViewModel : viewModel
KeyboardInputActionPlayerHost --> KeyboardViewModel : viewModel

InputConnectionBridge -up-|> ImeOutputBridge : 实现 [:app]
EditTextBridge -up-|> ImeOutputBridge : 实现 [:ime-ui]

' ===== 数据流标注 =====

note bottom of KeyboardViewModel
  **ViewModel 与 :app 的交互**
  仅通过构造参数注入的 ImeEngine 完成

  三类 API:
  1. 状态读取: state, config, layoutMode, feedbackState, actionPlayer
  2. 意图分发: handleGesture(), handleIntent()
  3. 运行时配置: updateConfig(), setLayoutMode(), updateKeyLayoutState()

  ViewModel 不感知:
  - InputConnectionBridge (由 :app 管理)
  - ConfigDataStore (由 :app 管理)
  - IMEService 生命周期 (由 :app 管理)
end note

note top of IMEService
  **IMEService 创建流程**
  1. onCreate(): 创建 ImeEngine + 挂载 InputConnectionBridge
  2. onCreateInputView(): ComposeView → KeyboardViewModel.Factory(engine) → KeyboardHost
  3. onDestroy(): 断开桥梁 → 清空引用

  **关键设计**: ViewModel 不持有桥梁
  桥梁由 IMEService 管理
  与 ViewModel 生命周期独立
end note

@enduml
